[{"title":"送同年王在中编修代祀西行（六首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"联镳席帽杏园春，五见宫花照路尘。\n今日分携重惆怅，顺承门外草如茵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8543,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送同年王在中编修代祀西行（六首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"娇儿文褓语初莺，内子閒闺数驿程。\n自是曲江春酒重，不堪芳樾听鹃声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8544,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送同年王在中编修代祀西行（六首） 其五","author":"宋褧","text":"同年折桂复同官，同巷衡门指顾间。\n纵是薄情诗兴涩，可能无句到阳关。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8545,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送同年王在中编修代祀西行（六首） 其六","author":"宋褧","text":"蜀山秦树碧相连，鸟道花开三月天。\n马上从来诗句好，定应多费薛涛笺。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8546,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"街柳为暴风所折谩赋绝句","author":"宋褧","text":"妆点官街能几春，经行常羡绿阴匀。\n邻翁只怪南风恶，不道年来蠹满身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8547,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"城南小雨","author":"宋褧","text":"官街杨柳绿参差，花外危亭俯路岐。\n物色宜人总依旧，天阴不似去年时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8548,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送曹义省亲新淦","author":"宋褧","text":"亲在江南子在都，担簦戏綵事难俱。\n宁馨学业今如此，郎罢还教食肉无。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8549,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"詹事府承宣使方君恕还岳阳（四首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"银榜宫前近识君，当时悔不早知闻。\n相逢未尽忘形话，又逐燕鸿度冥云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8550,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"詹事府承宣使方君恕还岳阳（四首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"古来词客不胜愁，感慨悲歌谩白头。\n君若到家无事日，等閒莫上岳阳楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8551,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"詹事府承宣使方君恕还岳阳（四首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"腊酒浓斟白玉卮，寒梅香缀碧苔枝。\n知君不作京华梦，睡到山城日出时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8552,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"詹事府承宣使方君恕还岳阳（四首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"江南才子总知名，久别烦君为寄声。\n说道头颅将四十，髭须先白两三茎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8553,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送李文清之官八番宣慰司幕府（三首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"马谙旧路不崎岖，草色新袍是故吾。\n山鸟山花总相识，莫将诗句咏娵隅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8554,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送李文清之官八番宣慰司幕府（三首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"西南边徼渺烟霞