"text":"暮宿悬匏昼出飞，笑他辛苦杏花泥。\n邻家灶突多炎上，犹自双双得意栖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8561,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送张尚德还长沙（四首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"闻君家住古长沙，吴楚川途万里赊。\n九衢夏木皆尘土，归棹惟应看藕花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8562,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送张尚德还长沙（四首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"江山风露夜凄清，散入心脾爽气生。\n重来写作金声赋，莫向时人鸣不平。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8563,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送张尚德还长沙（四首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"枫林水驿旧留连，小小歌谣四五篇。\n烦君说向沙鸥道，今日才情减昔年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8564,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送张尚德还长沙（四首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"洞庭如海山如黛，畴昔扁舟数往还。\n今日因君倍惆怅，功名无味钓槎閒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8565,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送刘克让归汴中三首（名天秩由河南乡贡中第竞以便养辞馆阁之职除济宁录事须次觐省） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"梁园词客卯金刀，五十人中赋手高。\n却是邹枚有神授，他州解送敢争豪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8566,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送刘克让归汴中三首（名天秩由河南乡贡中第竞以便养辞馆阁之职除济宁录事须次觐省） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"苑墙霏雨拂春旌，兴圣宫前晓唱名。\n闻道明经传奕叶，宁馨今日被恩荣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8567,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送刘克让归汴中三首（名天秩由河南乡贡中第竞以便养辞馆阁之职除济宁录事须次觐省） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"玉树瀛洲总列仙，徒劳州县亦堪怜。\n趋庭不羡长安乐，还上河津画鹢船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8568,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送翰林编修赵宗吉秦蜀降香便道觐省（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"九重端拱不时巡，宣室斋心礼百神。\n奠璧沉牛唯遣使，东封西祀肯劳民。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8569,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送翰林编修赵宗吉秦蜀降香便道觐省（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"锦衣玉节照皇都，紫陌春风拂传车。\n行役不须愁万里，过家能似汉相如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8570,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和省郎杜德常清明三绝兼柬王君实艺林 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"开门景物苦无涯，柳拂青丝杏衬霞。\n酝藉仙郎谁得似，官曹常对紫薇花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8571,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和省郎杜德常清明三绝兼柬王君实艺林 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"春闺无事不闻鸡，睡起朝阳树影西。\n尽道陌头寒食好，卖花声里有莺啼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8572,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和省郎杜德常清明三绝兼柬王君实艺林 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"赤阑桥瞰花溪过，白板扉临柳岸开。\n最好苑墙东畔路，可人何事不频来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8573,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送湖州李教授之官（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"软红尘里换青衫，弹铗歌残策去骖。\n不用临岐重惆怅，落花迎棹过江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8574,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送湖州李教授之官（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"笔翰超然松雪仙，丹青已矣霅溪笺。\n高斋应有横经暇，品画临书亦自贤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8575,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"群鱼龟蟹图","author":"宋褧","text":"紫蟹玄龟素鬣鱼，悠扬作队出菰蒲。\n吴中饿殍须南食，肠断腥风是画图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8576,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送新安王元成赴辽阳教官（二首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"三月边城未见花，榆关尽处草连沙。\n举头只见长安日，忘却江东是故家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8577,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送新安王元成赴辽阳教官（二首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"闻道东人乐事并，舞姬酬锦曲酬绫。\n广文别有诗书味，自分皋比冷似冰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8578,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"揆初堂（关中某氏永感之后寿日避客之所）","author":"宋褧","text":"二十年前具庆时，彩衣歌吹进琼卮。\n而今亦有如渑酒，自顾微驱欲奉谁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8579,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"尧民图","author":"宋褧","text":"歌谣人物接康衢，和气氤氲溢八区。\n日晷悠悠才过午，周人酒诰汉人酺。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8580,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"凤城雪霁收灯后，乌府风清奏牍馀。\n道路行人传好语，艺文学士拜新除。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8581,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"折桂蟾宫近十年，品流第一冠群仙。\n颂台藏室遨游遍，御史分司又占先。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8582,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"一代才华百事堪，祥麟威凤木楩楠。\n愿携云阁修书笔，移向惠文冠后篸。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8583,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"樊川韦曲称閒情，卉木林泉画不成。\n毕竟高明挂霄汉，终南峻岭渭流清。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8584,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其五","author":"宋褧","text":"鲁郭原头才拜扫，双清亭上罢吟哦。\n黄尘发轫关河路，奈此骚人标致何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8585,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其六","author":"宋褧","text":"十二官街踏雪泥，归来门巷晚凄迷。\n故人忽报明朝去，横玉一声春日低。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8586,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其七","author":"宋褧","text":"江东日暮碧云阴，前月缄书锦鲤沉。\n渭北春天多绿树，又从何处觅乔林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8587,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其八","author":"宋褧","text":"同年分袂不通书，陇峤巴川星散居。\n骢马经行能问讯，定应投刺不踌躇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8588,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其九","author":"宋褧","text":"生长何曾出帝城，马蹄一旦赴咸京。\n子长游览文章健，张掖滇池在此行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8589,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王君实西台御史（十首） 其十","author":"宋褧","text":"芙蓉秋水锦生花，羲献风流是故家。\n谁敢持缣叩厅阁，多应判牒走龙蛇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8590,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王伯修内翰奉母之官南台御史（六首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"冯驩时动剑歌声，忽听乘骢建业行。\n侍御虽然曾识面，台端共说旧闻名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8591,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王伯修内翰奉母之官南台御史（六首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"今代銮坡匠手閒，故教持斧出江关。\n多应湖海频移节，敢望君王早赐环。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8592,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王伯修内翰奉母之官南台御史（六首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"九重天子恩如海，雷雨斯须遍八荒。\n南土不寒多草木，却愁无地著秋霜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8593,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王伯修内翰奉母之官南台御史（六首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"无悰莫饮采石酒，有耳休听商女歌。\n揽辔归来无一事，蒋山高处看烟萝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8594,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王伯修内翰奉母之官南台御史（六首） 其五","author":"宋褧","text":"漳河潞河水悠悠，夫君去上沙棠舟。\n承颜无复别亲苦，分袂但增知己愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8595,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送王伯修内翰奉母之官南台御史（六首） 其六","author":"宋褧","text":"伯修思子马如飞，兼善携家棹且迟。\n邂逅故人烦寄语，故人挥麈日评诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8596,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渡济河马上初见近城诸山","author":"宋褧","text":"华山高耸鹊山东，一带烟霏翠接空。\n安石从来多雅兴，却如新妇闭车中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8597,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中秋与吕仲实清话忆溉之李内翰不见","author":"宋褧","text":"大明湖上水涵天，月色偏宜李谪仙。\n应笑吾曹杀风景，碧桐窗下对灯眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8598,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和州孝子黄钺父病痈笃孝子醮愿减年以益父寿果再生十年","author":"宋褧","text":"上帝高居虎豹关，尘寰蝼蚁敢相干。\n宁馨别有延年术，一寸灵台九转丹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8599,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬日杂诗（五首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"暗尘驽马夕阳酣，冻路凌兢思不堪。\n徥侣徒行知捷径，踏冰时过象坊南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8600,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬日杂诗（五首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"金水桥西沙路低，东来翠幰与桥齐。\n不知夫婿何官职，后拥前驱过曲堤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8601,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬日杂诗（五首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"下床指直难结带，出户舌卷深入喉。\n共羡将军能出猎，党家帐里不风流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8602,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬日杂诗（五首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"金阙银宫上帝居，绿章封事达云衢。\n晓来官吏传相告，明日放生仍断屠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8603,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"冬日杂诗（五首） 其五","author":"宋褧","text":"扫除愁恨惟应酒，陶写襟灵仅有诗。\n四十头颅只如此，可能心事及游丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8604,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过海子观浴象","author":"宋褧","text":"四蹄如柱鼻垂云，踏碎春泥乱水纹。\n鸂?鵁鶄好风景，一时惊散不成群。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8605,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送赵伯常淮西宪副（六首） 其一","author":"宋褧","text":"十年前是紫薇郎，伴我书声隔粉墙。\n今日绣衣持斧去，冲冠毛发半秋霜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8606,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送赵伯常淮西宪副（六首） 其二","author":"宋褧","text":"元龙湖海旧襟期，叔度汪洋万顷陂。\n知君不作媕娿态，拟见澄清报盛时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8607,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送赵伯常淮西宪副（六首） 其三","author":"宋褧","text":"天北天南赋远游，合肥城下理松楸。\n多应梦见还家乐，无复眉攒去国愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8608,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送赵伯常淮西宪副（六首） 其四","author":"宋褧","text":"常日相陪散马蹄，官曹同事凤城西。\n别来应忆太禧白，醉后仍须乌迭泥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":8609,